ment","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"月經問題是婦科門診最常見的主訴。本頁整理正常月經與經期衛生、不正常子宮出血、無月經、多囊性卵巢症候群、痛經、經前症候群與毒性休克症候群，以及更年期的變化與照護；月經週期與激素見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"female-reproductive-system#menstrual-cycle"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"月經週期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，荷爾蒙療法與避孕藥見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"sex-hormones"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"性激素藥物：避孕藥、更年期荷爾蒙療法、抗雄性素與不孕症用藥"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，子宮肌瘤與子宮內膜異位見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"benign-gynecologic-disorders"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"婦科良性疾病與婦科手術護理"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，陰道炎見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"sexually-transmitted-infections"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"性傳染病"}]},{"type":"text","value":"。文中縮寫：AUB（Abnormal uterine bleeding，不正常子宮出血）、PCOS（Polycystic ovary syndrome，多囊性卵巢症候群）、PMS（Premenstrual syndrome，經前症候群）、PMDD（Premenstrual dysphoric disorder，經期前情緒低落症）、NSAIDs（Nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs，非類固醇抗發炎藥）、FSH（Follicle-stimulating hormone，濾泡刺激素）、LH（Luteinizing hormone，黃體生成素）、LDL（Low-density lipoprotein，低密度脂蛋白）"}]}]},"sections":[{"id":"summary","depth":2,"number":"一、","title":"重點摘要","children":[{"id":"exam-points","depth":3,"number":"(一)","title":"國考常考點","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"原發性痛經是"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"痙攣性"}]},{"type":"text","value":"疼痛、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"月經開始前數小時"}]},{"type":"text","value":"出現、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"來潮初期最明顯"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；充血性悶痛、月經前一週開始、整個經期都痛是續發性